1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:03,430
Oh, if it isn't Mrs. Dead-To-Me.

2
00:00:04,219 --> 00:00:05,259
(Steph:)Hello, Howard.

3
00:00:05,428 --> 00:00:07,518
- Sheldon?
- I'm sorry, you violated...

4
00:00:07,680 --> 00:00:11,270
(Sheldon:)...the terms of your metaphor
by acknowledging her existence. I'm out.

5
00:00:12,685 --> 00:00:14,355
(Leonard:)He just won't listen to me.

6
00:00:14,521 --> 00:00:17,061
Okay, well, I guess
it'll just be the three of us then.

7
00:00:17,232 --> 00:00:20,442
- Yeah. Lisa's gonna be disappointed.
STEPHANIE: Yeah.

8
00:00:20,610 --> 00:00:22,030
(Howard:)Lisa?

9
00:00:22,570 --> 00:00:25,110
(Steph:)Yeah, my roommate.
She just went through a bad breakup.

10
00:00:25,281 --> 00:00:28,031
(Steph:)I thought she might like to meet
somebody fun like you.

11
00:00:29,285 --> 00:00:33,705
(Howard:)Leonard, Stephanie, you're alive.
It's a miracle.

12
00:00:36,543 --> 00:00:38,873
(Howard:)So anyway, Lisa,
I just wanted to tell you again...

13
00:00:39,045 --> 00:00:43,965
(Howard:)...how much I enjoyed the other night,
and again, I'm sorry for how it ended.

14
00:00:45,677 --> 00:00:48,007
(Howard:)But again,
if you could let me know about Friday...

15
00:00:48,179 --> 00:00:51,719
(Howard:)...my mother needs a head count
so she can know how big a brisket to get.

16
00:00:51,891 --> 00:00:53,141
(Leonard:)Howard. Look at this.

17
00:00:53,309 --> 00:00:54,389
[MAN SPEAKING INDISTINCTLY ON TV]

18
00:00:54,561 --> 00:00:57,651
(Howard:)Anyway, call me. It's Howard.

19
00:00:59,107 --> 00:01:02,027
ANNOUNCER [ON TV]: It's unclear how
the Mars rover got into the crevice...

20
00:01:02,193 --> 00:01:03,653
...but one thing's certain:

21
00:01:03,820 --> 00:01:07,570
(Voice from TV:)The data which it has sent back
contain the first clear indications...

22
00:01:07,740 --> 00:01:11,030
(Voice from TV:)...that there may have been life on Mars.

23
00:01:12,078 --> 00:01:13,828
(Voice from TV:)It's a scientific discovery...

24
00:01:13,997 --> 00:01:16,837
(Voice from TV:)...that has staggering implications
for all mankind.

25
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:21,210
(Voice from TV:)Unfortunately,
we'll never know who's responsible.

26
00:01:25,550 --> 00:01:28,510
(Howard:)Son of a bitch.

